  "solution": "Số hộ gia đình trong xóm là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Số nhân khẩu trung bình của mỗi hộ gia đình là\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>:</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSắp xếp số nhân khẩu của 30 gia đình theo thứ tự không giảm, ta được\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>3</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inli